WEBVTT

00:03:58.397 --> 00:04:01.960
And the leaders in this space
are doing a few things very differently

00:04:01.984 --> 00:04:04.160
from traditional heroic leaders.

00:04:05.125 --> 00:04:07.379
They set goals differently,

00:04:07.403 --> 00:04:09.783
they announce those goals differently

00:04:09.807 --> 00:04:13.125
and they have a very different
relationship with other people.

00:04:13.593 --> 00:04:15.875
Let's begin with the first difference.

00:04:16.839 --> 00:04:21.402
A hero sets a goal
that can be individually delivered

00:04:21.426 --> 00:04:22.759
and neatly measured.

00:04:23.815 --> 00:04:25.641
You can recognize a heroic goal --

00:04:25.665 --> 00:04:28.683
they use terms like
"revenue" and "market share"

00:04:28.707 --> 00:04:30.612
and are often competitive.